# Fill this in once and every example here can use it.
#
# Each example also reads a `.env` in its own directory, which takes precedence —
# so use this file for the values that are the same everywhere (your API key), and
# a local one only when you want to override something for a single example.
#
# Copy to `.env` (note the leading dot; most editors hide it) and never commit it.

# ---- The credential we issued you -----------------------------------------
# Looks like obliq_prod_<key id>_<secret>. Authenticates YOU to OBLIQ.
# Request one: https://xyra-labs.mintlify.site/guides/onboarding/request-access
OBLIQ_API_KEY=

# ---- Your own wallet -------------------------------------------------------
# base58 secret key of a THROWAWAY wallet. This signs the transaction; it never
# leaves your machine and we never see it. Not the same thing as the API key.
USER_WALLET_SECRET_KEY=

# ---- Endpoints (defaults are production; override only if you need to) -----
# OBLIQ_RPC_URL=https://solana-paymaster-mainnet.kanalabs.io/rpc
# SOLANA_RPC_URL=https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com

# ---- Per-example settings --------------------------------------------------
# Anything from an example's own .env.example also works here. The ones people
# reach for first, with their defaults:
#
#   AMOUNT_USDC=1.0        swap/ and transfer-usdc/ — how much to spend
#   AMOUNT_SOL=0.001       transfer-sol/            — how much to send
#   RECIPIENT=             the transfers            — blank picks a throwaway
#   SLIPPAGE_BPS=50        swap/                    — 0.5%
#
# See each example's .env.example for the full set.
